ervices/book-groups\" class=\"node node--type-localgov-guides-overview node--view-mode-related-links\">\n\n  \n  <div class=\"node__content\">\n    <a href=\"/culture-and-sport/libraries/library-services/book-groups\" class=\"field-group-link card-link\" hreflang=\"en\">\n            <div class=\"field field--name-extra-field-bbd-extra-fields-title field--type-extra-field field--label-hidden field__item\"><h3 class=\"title-field page-title\">Book groups</h3>\n</div>\n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>Talk about books in an informal, friendly space. Find a book group that suits you.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      </a>\n  </div>\n\n</article>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"field__item\">\n<article about=\"/culture-and-sport/arts-and-culture/explore-culture-southwark\" class=\"node node--type-localgov-directory node--view-mode-related-links\">\n\n  \n  <div class=\"node__content\">\n    <a href=\"/culture-and-sport/arts-and-culture/explore-culture-southwark\" class=\"field-group-link card-link\" hreflang=\"en\">\n            <div class=\"field field--name-extra-field-bbd-extra-fields-title field--type-extra-field field--label-hidden field__item\"><h3 class=\"title-field page-title\">Explore culture in Southwark</h3>\n</div>\n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>Find theatres, galleries, museums and more in the borough.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      </a>\n  </div>\n\n</article>\n</div>\n              </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"field field--name-localgov-page-components field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__items\">\n              <div class=\"field__item\">\n            <div class=\"field field--name-paragraphs field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__item\">\n  <div class=\"bg-purple paragraph paragraph--type--gov-delivery-newsletter clearfix paragr