92.8 464 400 456.8 400 448V192H48V448z\"/></svg></span>  <span class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__trigger-text\">\n    Add to Calendar\n  </span>\n</button>\n\n  <dialog class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__dialog\">\n    <div class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__dialog-close\">\n      <button class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__dialog-close-button\" type=\"button\" name=\"closeAddToCalendarDialog\">\n        Close\n      </button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__items\">\n\n      <div class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__item\">\n        <a href=\"    https://www.google.com/calendar/r/eventedit?text=Black History Month: Sonic Cultures\n          &dates=\n              20261004T170000Z\n              /20261004T225900Z\n                  &location=Prince of Peckham, London, SW15 5JA\n        \" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Add to Google Calendar</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__item\">\n        <a href=\"data:text/calendar;charset=utf8,BEGIN:VCALENDAR%0AVERSION:2.0%0ABEGIN:VEVENT%0ADTSTART:20261004T170000Z%0ADTEND:20261004T225900Z%0ASUMMARY:Black History Month: Sonic Cultures%0ALOCATION: Prince of Peckham, London, SW15 5JA%0AEND:VEVENT%0AEND:VCALENDAR\">Add to iCal</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__item\">\n        <a href=\"data:text/calendar;charset=utf8,BEGIN:VCALENDAR%0AVERSION:2.0%0ABEGIN:VEVENT%0ADTSTART:20261004T170000Z%0ADTEND:20261004T225900Z%0ASUMMARY:Black History Month: Sonic Cultures%0ALOCATION: Prince of Peckham, London, SW15 5JA%0AEND:VEVENT%0AEND:VCALENDAR\">Add to Outlook</a>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </dialog>\n\n</div>\n\n        \n<div  class=\"event-hero\">\n    \n<div  class=\"event-intro\">\n    \n<div  class=\"text-wrapper\">\n    <a href=\"/southwark-presents\" class=\"link-back\">Back</a>\n<div  class=\"event-intro-wrapper\">\n    <div><div id=\"block-bbd-localgov-breadcrumbs\" class=\"block block-system block-system-breadcrumb-block\">\n  \n    \n      \n  \n\n  <nav class=\"breadcrumbs\" aria-labelledby=\"system-breadcrumbs\">\n    <h2 id=\"system-breadcrumbs\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Breadcrumbs</h2>\n    <ol class=\"breadcrumbs__list\">\n              <li class=\"breadcrumbs__item\">\n                      <a class=\"breadcrumbs__link\" href=\"/\">Home</a>\n                    </li>\n              <li class=\"breadcrumbs__item\">\n                      <a class=\"breadcrumbs__link\" href=\"/southwark-presents\">Southwark Presents</a>\n                    </li>\n              <li class=\"breadcrumbs__item\">\n                        Black History Month: Sonic Cultures\n                  </li>\n                </ol>\n  </nav>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-extra-field-bbd-extra-fields-title field--type-extra-field field--label-hidden field__item\"><h1 class=\"title-field page-title\">Black History Month: Sonic Cultures</h1>\n</div>\n      \n            <div class=\"share-links-field-wrapper extra-field-wrapper field field--name-extra-field-bbd-extra-fields-share-links field--type-extra-field field--label-hidden field__item\"></div>\n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-summary field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>Black History Month: Sonic Cultures</p>\n<p>Rhythm. Identity. Connection.</p>\n<p>This Black History Month join us for Sonic Cultures, an evening celebrating Caribbean, African and Indigenous cultures, heritage, music, movement and community.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-key-info field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">This is a publicly contributed event and not a council event. If you would like, you can submit your own event and have it appear on our website (subject to review).</div>\n      \n  </div>\n  </div>\n            <div class=\"field field--name-localgov-event-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\"><div>\n  \n  \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item\">    <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/large_3_2_2x/public/2026-09/Sonic%20Cultures%20-%20Black%20History%20Month.png?h=5dcbbc94&amp;itok=P3nwaHAU 1x\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" type=\"image/png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\"/>\n                  <img loading=\"eager\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/large_3_2_768x512/public/2026-09/Sonic%20Cultures%20-%20Black%20History%20Month.png?h=5dcbbc94&amp;itok=sxkNnLPf\" alt=\"Black History Month: Sonic Cultures\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" />\n\n  </picture>\n\n</div>\n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-caption field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item\">Black History Month: Sonic Cultures</div>\n      \n</div>\n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n  </div>\n<div  class=\"event-content\">\n    \n<div  class=\"event-column column-first\">\n    \n<div  class=\"date-wrapper\">\n  <h2>Date</h2>\n    \n      <div class=\"field field--name-localgov-event-date field--type-date-recur field--label-hidden field__items\">\n              <div class=\"field__item\">\n  <div class=\"event-next-date\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Date: </div>\n    <p class=\"field field-date date-recur-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-10-04T18:00:00Z\">Sunday, 4 October 2026</time>\n</p>\n  </div>\n\n      <div class=\"event-time\">\n      <div class=\"field__label\">Time: </div>\n      <p class=\"field field-time date-recur-time\"><time datetime=\"2026-10-04T18:00:00Z\">6:00pm</time>\n - <time datetime=\"2026-10-04T23:59:00Z\">11:59pm</time>\n</p>\n    </div>\n  \n</div>\n          </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-how-often field--type-string field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">How often</div>\n              <div class=\"field__item\">In time.</div>\n          </div>\n\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"field field--name-extra-field-bbd-extra-field-bbd-event-date-slider field--type-extra-field field--label-hidden field__items\">\n              <div class=\"field__item\"></div>\n          </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Description</div>\n              <div class=\"field__item\"><p>Black History Month: Sonic Cultures</p><p>Rhythm. Identity. Connection.</p><p>This Black History Month join us for Sonic Cultures, an evening celebrating Caribbean, African and Indigenous cultures, heritage, music, movement and community.</p><p>And where better to bring Sonic Cultures to life than the wonderful Prince of Peckham?</p><p>We will be gathering in the heart of Peckham for an immersive experience bringing together live drumming, dance, cultural conversation, networking and connection. 🖤</p><p>Creating space to celebrate where we are from, explore who we are and unite with one another.</p><p>🥁 Live Drumming<br>💃🏾 Dance &amp; Movement🕺🏾<br>🎤 Cultural Conversations<br>💬 Meaningful Connection &amp; Community<br>🎧 Live DJ<br>🤝🏿 Networking</p><p>From the first beat to the final track, Sonic Cultures is about bringing generations and experiences together through the power of sound and culture.</p><p>Come ready to listen, share, move, connect and celebrate.🖤</p><p>What to expect?</p><p>An evening that moves between energy and reflection. From the rhythms of the drums, to conversations around identity and culture, to music that brings everyone together.</p><p>Native attire is encouraged but not required. Come dressed in a way that celebrates your culture and personal style.</p><p>💎 Sunday the 4th of October 2026<br>💎 5PM – Midnight<br>💎 Last entry: 8PM<br>💎 16+</p><p>Come for the rhythm. Stay for the conversation. Leave connected. 🙌🏾</p><p>🎟️ Tickets are limited.</p><p>This is Sonic Cultures. Volume 11.</p><p>Come and be part of something special. 🖤</p></div>\n          </div>\n\n  </div>\n<div  class=\"event-column\">\n    \n<div  class=\"tickets-wrapper\">\n  <h2>Tickets</h2>\n    \n      <div class=\"field field--name-field-ticket-price field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items\">\n              <div class=\"field__item\">\n  <div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--ticket-price clearfix paragraph--view-mode--default\" id=\"ticket_price_12980\">\n    <div class=\"paragraph-inner-holder inner-wrapper\">\n              \n          </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n              <div class=\"field__item\">\n  <div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--ticket-price clearfix paragraph--view-mode--default\" id=\"ticket_price_12981\">\n    <div class=\"paragraph-inner-holder inner-wrapper\">\n              \n          </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n              <div class=\"field__item\">\n  <div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--ticket-price clearfix paragraph--view-mode--default\" id=\"ticket_price_12982\">\n    <div class=\"paragraph-inner-holder inner-wrapper\">\n              \n          </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n          </div>\n  \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-book-tickets field--type-link field--label-hidden field__item\"><a href=\"https://shoobs.com/events/162282/black-history-month-sonic-cultures\">https://shoobs.com/events/162282/black-history-month-sonic-cultures</a></div>\n      \n  </div>\n  <div class=\"field field--name-localgov-event-location field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Location</div>\n              <div class=\"field__item\">\n<article>\n      \n  <div class=\"field field--name-postal-address field--type-address field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Address</div>\n              <div class=\"field__item\"><p class=\"address\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"address-line1\">Prince of Peckham</span><br>\n<span class=\"address-line2\">1 Clayton Road</span><br>\n<span class=\"locality\">London</span><br>\n<span class=\"postal-code\">SW15 5JA</span><br>\n<span class=\"country\">United Kingdom</span></p><a href=\"https://google.com/maps?q=Prince%20of%20Peckham%201%20Clayton%20Road%20London%20SW15%205JA%20GB\" class=\"address-map-link\" target=\"_blank\">Show on maps</a></div>\n          </div>\n  </article>\n</div>\n          </div>\n\n  </div>\n  </div>\n<div  class=\"event-content event-content-lower\">\n    \n<div  class=\"event-column column-first-lower\">\n    <div class=\"field--name-field-other-events-like-this\"><div class=\"field__label\">Other events like this</div><div class=\"field--items field__items view view-automate-related-events view-id-automate_related_events view-display-id-block_1\">\n  \n    \n      \n      <div class=\"view-content\">\n          <div class=\"field__item views-row\">\n<article about=\"/southwark-presents/make-your-own-traffic-lights-una-marson-library\" class=\"node node--type-localgov-event node--promoted node--view-mode-featured-event\">\n  \n  <div class=\"node__content\">\n    <a href=\"/southwark-presents/make-your-own-traffic-lights-una-marson-library\" class=\"field-group-link card-link\" hreflang=\"en\">\n<div  class=\"image-wrapper\">\n    \n            <div class=\"field field--name-localgov-event-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\"><div>\n  \n  \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item\">    <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/large_3_2_2x/public/2026-09/Make%20your%20own%20traffic%20light.png?h=387b6cd7&amp;itok=WO9A1xJ- 1x\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" type=\"image/png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\"/>\n                  <img loading=\"eager\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/large_3_2_768x512/public/2026-09/Make%20your%20own%20traffic%20light.png?h=387b6cd7&amp;itok=LUlDuQKB\" alt=\"traffic light craft\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" />\n\n  </picture>\n\n</div>\n      \n</div>\n</div>\n      \n<div  cl