          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" prefix=\"content: http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/  dc: http://purl.org/dc/terms/  foaf: http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/  og: http://ogp.me/ns#  rdfs: http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#  schema: http://schema.org/  sioc: http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#  sioct: http://rdfs.org/sioc/types#  skos: http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#  xsd: http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema# \" class=\"sticky-header-html\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\nnew Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\nj=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&amp;l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\n'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\n})(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-P59KV5');\n</script>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Harold Moody and Not Our Problem is a thought-provoking documentary screening exploring Black history in Southwark through the themes of racial equality, activism, and community resilience. The films examine Dr Harold Moody’s pioneering campaign against racial discrimination in Britain and share powerful accounts of the experiences of Black communities living in Southwark during the 1980s. Together, they offer valuable insights into local history and the ongoing struggle for social justice, encouraging reflection and discussion.\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.southwark.gov.uk/southwark-presents/harold-moody-and-not-our-problem-nunhead-library\" />\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Drupal 10 | LocalGov Drupal powered by Big Blue Door | https://www.bigbluedoor.net/localgov-drupal\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"width\" />\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"true\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/core/misc/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/vnd.microsoft.icon\" />\n<script>window.a2a_config=window.a2a_config||{};a2a_config.callbacks=[];a2a_config.overlays=[];a2a_config.templates={};a2a_config.static_server= \"https://www.southwark.gov.uk/sites/default/files/addtoany/menu/iho16r34\";a2a_config.icon_color = \"#3B4395\";</script>\n\n    <title>Harold Moody and Not Our Problem - Nunhead Library | Southwark Council</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" href=\"/sites/default/files/css/css_4_RhvxdIG8RcNP4zoeP-ygktN1Jx53V-S5zDdy9iacU.css?delta=0&amp;language=en&amp;theme=bbd_localgov&amp;include=eJx9UYGqwyAM_CGtn1SiZqssmpLEvde_f3YU1nXwQCR3F8l5gZyNoW0BjmK6CTdzUAKU-U4cgVyE9JiNx1nDqZ5L4uZizHPqalzDXt75OVc0KemlrCBwF1gXDZ9wUtsIXz0m0JTACrdwwS6xYEhcV27YTCfiBLTPiKDo_XDtjf3gsGUQh79GpT1Clr4CTQd0H69CFIScpNeoFwWf-5ALeWOpHkVYvpROdKGOxD7Jiq37CqVdeLWSHptfhh2Ut6Y9ajHUc3j_ie7Ud3z8lHNva49UdMHslFMBGvvJBeY9GQ3f1GQLVnS6qeHY6TDqngV_NLzuqXLuhH-nB96v\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" href=\"/sites/default/files/css/css_5qfHpwUKE_sIcu7ImcWRqCnmgkIaAE6DdeCM-fAQpJo.css?delta=1&amp;language=en&amp;theme=bbd_localgov&amp;include=eJx9UYGqwyAM_CGtn1SiZqssmpLEvde_f3YU1nXwQCR3F8l5gZyNoW0BjmK6CTdzUAKU-U4cgVyE9JiNx1nDqZ5L4uZizHPqalzDXt75OVc0KemlrCBwF1gXDZ9wUtsIXz0m0JTACrdwwS6xYEhcV27YTCfiBLTPiKDo_XDtjf3gsGUQh79GpT1Clr4CTQd0H69CFIScpNeoFwWf-5ALeWOpHkVYvpROdKGOxD7Jiq37CqVdeLWSHptfhh2Ut6Y9ajHUc3j_ie7Ud3z8lHNva49UdMHslFMBGvvJBeY9GQ3f1GQLVnS6qeHY6TDqngV_NLzuqXLuhH-nB96v\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"print\" href=\"/sites/default/files/css/css_GGj7k1XDqwwxy22N7Zz0msBCp2Ls2_1g0NA9kLRo_nE.css?delta=2&amp;language=en&amp;theme=bbd_localgov&amp;include=eJx9UYGqwyAM_CGtn1SiZqssmpLEvde_f3YU1nXwQCR3F8l5gZyNoW0BjmK6CTdzUAKU-U4cgVyE9JiNx1nDqZ5L4uZizHPqalzDXt75OVc0KemlrCBwF1gXDZ9wUtsIXz0m0JTACrdwwS6xYEhcV27YTCfiBLTPiKDo_XDtjf3gsGUQh79GpT1Clr4CTQd0H69CFIScpNeoFwWf-5ALeWOpHkVYvpROdKGOxD7Jiq37CqVdeLWSHptfhh2Ut6Y9ajHUc3j_ie7Ud3z8lHNva49UdMHslFMBGvvJBeY9GQ3f1GQLVnS6qeHY6TDqngV_NLzuqXLuhH-nB96v\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" href=\"/s